":379601,"en":"He is a people who don't want to go."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1104:b003:l040","ordinal":379602,"en":"The place is thick and strong,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l001","ordinal":379603,"en":"The Burut are not a people to trifle with,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l002","ordinal":379604,"en":"That looming mottled ridge—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l003","ordinal":379605,"en":"Is no toy hill to cross for sport,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l004","ordinal":379606,"en":"Nor are they ones who noisily stir up quarrels,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l005","ordinal":379607,"en":"They are not the people of Manchu,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l006","ordinal":379608,"en":"This is no land for casual scouting,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l007","ordinal":379609,"en":"They are not a people to face unprepared!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l008","ordinal":379610,"en":"Great nation of forty-tribed China,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l009","ordinal":379611,"en":"Gather your armored khans,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l010","ordinal":379612,"en":"Do not let the common people be disgraced,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l011","ordinal":379613,"en":"Gather all your strongest men,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l012","ordinal":379614,"en":"Speaking softly, he gave firm counsel,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l013","ordinal":379615,"en":"Your renowned champion,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l014","ordinal":379616,"en":"Chongbilgich spoke and offered advice,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l015","ordinal":379617,"en":"The reason he began to speak was this:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l016","ordinal":379618,"en":"He was both a wrestler and a lion,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l017","ordinal":379619,"en":"A hero exceptionally skilled"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l018","ordinal":379620,"en":"In all the stratagems of war."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l019","ordinal":379621,"en":"Now Chongbilgich spoke as follows:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l020","ordinal":379622,"en":"“Let your armored strongmen come forth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l021","ordinal":379623,"en":"From among the bald ones girded with stones,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l022","ordinal":379624,"en":"Let your heroes who defend the nation come forth."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l023","ordinal":379625,"en":"When the black musket cracks,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l024","ordinal":379626,"en":"Let the bold man who does not turn in flight,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l025","ordinal":379627,"en":"Who does not dwell on death,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l026","ordinal":379628,"en":"The capable risk-taker, come forth."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l027","ordinal":379629,"en":"Against the vast, teeming host,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l028","ordinal":379630,"en":"Let your finest man, who charges unchecked, come forth!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l029","ordinal":379631,"en":"When the people are in turmoil,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l030","ordinal":379632,"en":"Advancing like a raging fire,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l031","ordinal":379633,"en":"When shouting and leveling the spear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l032","ordinal":379634,"en":"Let your champion of honor come forth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l033","ordinal":379635,"en":"Let your lion, a master of wisdom, come forth."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l034","ordinal":379636,"en":"If you wrestle him, that Kyrgyz is the hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l035","ordinal":379637,"en":"Seytek, a hero born of heroes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l036","ordinal":379638,"en":"If you grapple, that lion is the one,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l037","ordinal":379639,"en":"Who satisfies his desire in combat,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l038","ordinal":379640,"en":"That boundless hero."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l039","ordinal":379641,"en":"When he thrusts his spear, hearts faint,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b002:l040","ordinal":379642,"en":"Such are the white-capped Kyrgyz people."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b004:l001","ordinal":379643,"en":"They whirl their blue-mottled shields,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b004:l002","ordinal":379644,"en":"At the word of strife, at the word of foe,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b004:l003","ordinal":379645,"en":"They drink deep yet never have their fill of blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b004:l004","ordinal":379646,"en":"Their hems are broad and their road lies open,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b004:l005","ordinal":379647,"en":"Such are the people called the heroic Kyrgyz."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p1105:b004:l006","ordinal":379648,"en":"The cuckoo calls in swelling song,"}]
